l  current major characters in drum  switched outfits Luffy Ward Dec ooze  hero costume while hasta war Luffy's  outfit  along with his signature straw hat could  this before shattering that black clover  will become the next pirate king of  manga I guess we'll have to wait and see  finally in the manga Tabata gave us some  sketches he did for weekly shonen jump  where he made a solo hasta for the cover  of one issue and then a normal hasta for  the next issue so that the two would  form a pair if you line them up I  totally get why they picked hasta to be  Zorro since they both fight with swords  have the same number of swords currently  and both have used their mouths to swing  a sword  I love swords personally and I gotta say  I love the fact that we have another  short main character they use a sword  for battle shout out to ichigo fact  number 2 in an interview tabata was  asked which of the characters in black  clover is most like him he answered  hasta and his editor Katayama said and i  quote  it's definitely austin tabitha sensei is  always super positive and can never be  still not that we needed a third source  to confirm this but fellow shounen jump  mangaka you hey  Tamura confirms it anyway tamara worked  with tabata as an assistant to toshiaki  yachiru the creator of siren so the two  got to know each other really well for  the second volume of black clover tamara  created a special support manga for  tabata on account of the success he's  been having with black clover in the  short manga Tamara illustrates the first  time they met and in this manga he pokes  fun at how similar Tabata is to his  character  hasta instead of drawing Tabata he  simply draws hasta and writes that  Tabata even when he was a newbie was  exactly like black clovers main  character interestingly enough for  Tabitha's first serialization in shounen  jump which was called hungry Joker  he had according to him a pretty quiet  character I read a few chapters and the  main character's personality was much  more like you knows and he was a genius  scientist to boot the complete opposite  of  stuff he liked the idea of having a  quieter more dark main character but the  audience didn't respond well and that  manga got canceled so then Tabitha  learned from that failure and made hasta  a more happy-go-lucky character that was  easier to understand  he also made hasta really energetic like  himself and other famous Shonen  protagonists like Luffy and Naruto  luckily fans responded great to the loud  and more straightforward hasta which  brings us to fact number three let's  talk about Austin's popularity although  hasta is the main character that doesn't  always translate to being the most  popular character if we look at my hero  academia Baku go the main characters  rival has come and first place more  times than deku in the Shonen Jump  popularity polls hasta however has  managed to stay ahead of his rival you  know in the first Japanese poll hasta  came in first with 2911 posts and almost  1,000 votes behind in second place was  the man who seems to always be taking a  dump at the wrong time Yami in the  second Japanese poll hasta got first  place again and the distance from second  place which was Yami again grew as well  so in Japan Austin seems to have an  exceptionally strong hold on people's  hearts even for a main character the  English polls were a bit different  though the captain of the black bulls  managed to finish in first place both  times and hasta finished right behind  him in second place both times while  best girl Noel mares to finish third  place both times nevertheless hasta is  clearly an extremely popular character  at least among black clover fans and  that doesn't surprise me one bit how can  you not love someone who decides that  he'll become the wizard king when he  doesn't even have any magic hasta gives  the characters in the story and us the  readers and Watchers a great example to  look up to Austin reminds us that we all  possess the magic of not giving up but  it's up to us whether we'll activate  that magic or negated fact number four  in the official data book Austin scored  the lowest cost  we'll score in everything that had to do  with magic  so in magic amount he scored a zero out  of five in magic control he scored  another zero and in magic sensing he  scored a third zero just to put this in  perspective you know scored a perfect  five in magic amount a strong foreign  magic control and another perfect five  in magic sensing clearly you know and  pretty much everyone else is more gifted  in magical abilities than hasta however  because hasta has so much trouble with  magic he decided that instead of whining  and doing nothing he would improve in  any way he could which meant training  his body as a result of this Austin  scored a very impressive five out of  five in physical strength he's one of  the physically strongest characters in  black clover thanks to his relentless  training on the other hand you know who  was blessed with amazing magical  abilities didn't feel the need to train  his body so in that area he scored less  than hasta a 3 out of 5 in cleverness  hasta scored a solid 4 out of 5 and his  bonus personalized measurement was  willpower and you can bet he score in a  perfect 5 out of 5 in that fact number 5  as with most manga before black clover  was serialized in Shonen Jump Tabata  created a one-shot manga it's pretty  much like a pitch for a manga series and  lucky for Tabata and for us people like  Tabitha's pitch although a lot of stuff  from the one shot was used in the  official manga there were some  interesting differences in the one shot  for instance there's no sister Lily in  the one shot instead of living in a  church Austin you know are in a magical  school surrounded by other magical  students kind of like Hogwarts since  Lily isn't in the picture you see hasta  confessing his feelings to a female  student but she flat-out rejects him so  yeah believe it or not Austin's favorite  person didn't exist in the one shot also  in the one shot hasta is not necessarily  an orphan  although we do not see his parents he  does have a last name stariha in  addition the villain in the one shot is  a noble student rather than a former  magic knight however despite the  differences Tabitha definitely stayed  true to the loudmouth magic list  hard-working and lovable auste from the  one shot fact number six you may be  surprised to learn that berserk the  mature dark fantasy manga was one of  Tabitha's biggest inspirations for black  clover but it's true in an interview he  said that with black clover he wanted to  make a manga like berserk but for the  Shonan demographic this made so much  sense to me when I discovered this  interview as I read the manga William  from Golden Dawn gave off an  unmistakable Griffith vibe and in the  interview Tabata acknowledges that  that's what he was going for with the  character you can see the influence of  berserk in other ways too  Belle is reminiscent of puck Sol is  reminiscent of Casca and Yami in many  ways is reminiscent of guts however  perhaps the most obvious nod to berserk  is the black bull swordsman hasta auste  like guts is extremely strong and uses a  giant heavy sword that most people would  have trouble even picking up as his  weapon of choice let me know if you  noticed any references to other anime or  movies in black clover fact number 7 in  the manga volumes there is something  similar to all this question corner in  the one piece volumes where the mangaka  answers fans questions except in this  case tabitha calls it the assorted  questions brigade rather than the  question corner there are sometimes very  interesting questions that are asked and  sometimes when respond to thank  questions tabitha ranked specific  characters in terms of what is being  asked these are my favorite questions  because you get to see how the  characters rank among each other when  measured by a specific criteria and  honestly who doesn't like ranking anime  characters and austin is often a part of  these rankings for example in volume 9  one fan asked who is the smartest member  of the black bolts instead of just  answering who's the smartest tubba to  rank the members I found it interesting  to learn that the nose bleeding mirror  using sister lover got first and the  murmuring Marilyn Manson  looking Gordon got second and hasta was  at the end of the list in 11th place so  even if he's talented at fighting hasta  is not the smartest among the group of  misfits but neither is Goku from Dragon  Ball Z or Naruto from you guessed it  Naruto but that's never held a shounen  protagonist back from doing the  impossible surpassing their limits and  making their dreams come true in fact  maybe not overthinking stuff is one of  Austin's strengths next in volume 10  someone asked for the physical strength  rankings for black clover characters and  although he was beaten by Yami who got  first place Austin managed to come in  second his physical training definitely  paid off since this is an insanely  impressive feat scoring second at his  young age of 15 not only among black  bulls but among all of the magic knights  and villains and black clover is amazing  and the black foals are crushing it in  particular with both of the top two  physically strongest characters coming  from their ranks unfortunately though  when it came to the top five hottest  guys ranking Tabata said that Austin did  not make the cut not that that matters  though when girls like Noel and mimosa  are head over heels for our loudmouth  protagonists fact number 8 in the manga  there are character profiles that  explain some interesting details about a  specific character like birth date for  example since Austin and you know were  orphans who were left at the church for  their birthday we are given the day that  they were found at the church which was  October 4th it seems that they were both  just recently born when they were  brought there since both of them are  still libras perhaps not so  coincidentally the wizard King is also a  Libra being a Libra myself I love the  fact that so many awesome characters in  the show are also born in October and  happened to be libras as well now let's  just ignore the fact that there are also  some unsavory characters in black clover  who are also libras fact number 9  gakuto Kajiwara is the Japanese voice  actor behind haces often loud voice  this is Koji wadis first  major role and honestly the screaming  didn't bother me too much but I know  some people beg to differ  let me know how you feel about koalas  voice acting for hasta in the English  hasta is voiced by the 25 year old  Dallas J Reid who is also best known for  this role in particular you may also  know him as the attack Titan from class  1 B which hasta do you prefer fact  number 10 in lieu of one fact fact 10  will be a lucky lightning round of  random fact because at Anime uproar we  magically make the impossible possible  Ready Set three to one less Jam  Austin's blood type is a he is 155  centimeters tall or 5 foot 1 inches  which means he's shorter than most  he's even shorter than Noel and as a  result has to put up with being called  short stuff on his character profile for  likes Tabata just put sister Lily so  that gives you an idea of how obsessed  he is with her and finally Austin's  initial design sketches were a bit  different than they are now  since he didn't have his signature  headband or too insane muscles that his  current version has and that's it for  today's video thank you so much for  watching I'm so glad that I finally got  around to catching up to black clover  and making a video on it if you want to  see more black clover videos definitely  smash that like button and feel free to  suggest future black clover videos  you're burning up to see in the comments  if you haven't joined the black bowls of  YouTube by attacking that subscribe  button and ringing that magic YouTube  Bell and until next time see ya magic  cowboy  [Music]  you

